  "content": "<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/master/.github/assets/logo/logo.png\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"Friends&amp;Foes - 養蜂人小屋\" title=\"Friends&amp;Foes - 養蜂人小屋\">\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=請我喝咖啡&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"請我喝咖啡\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=成為贊助者&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&label=加入Discord社群&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"加入Discord社群\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=維基百科&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"維基百科\">\n\t</a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Friends&Foes - 養蜂人小屋是一個新增養蜂人小屋結構的小型附加模組。該結構可在草原和繁花森林生態域中找到。您可以查看<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">維基頁面</a>獲取更多關於養蜂人的資訊。</span>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/master/.github/assets/images/beekeeper_hut1.png\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/master/.github/assets/images/beekeeper_hut1.png\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"養蜂人小屋\" title=\"養蜂人小屋\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/master/.github/assets/images/beekeeper_hut2.png\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/master/.github/assets/images/beekeeper_hut2.png\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"養蜂人小屋\" title=\"養蜂人小屋\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>⚙️ 其他附加模組/資料包</h1>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms-fabric\">Friends&Foes - 花漾哞菇</a></li>\n\t<li><a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-friends-and-foes-datapack\">Repurposed Structures - Friends and Foes 相容資料包</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>💬 社群</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">歡迎隨時<a href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\">加入我們的Discord社群</a>聊天、分享作品、提出問題，或是單純追蹤模組最新開發動態與發布通知。也請不吝<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/issues\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">透過GitHub回報任何崩潰或錯誤</a>。</span>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>👋 支持</h1>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">開發模組是我的興趣，即使沒有贊助我也會持續更新，不過這確實佔用了我大部分空閒時間。若您仍想支持我，可以透過<a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\">Patreon</a>或<a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faboslav\">Ko-fi</a>贊助。無論如何，我衷心感謝所有支持。</span></p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>📜 授權</h1>\n\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">本模組採用<a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut/master/LICENSE.txt\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a>授權。</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">歡迎參考我的程式碼來學習如何實作與解決各種問題，並將片段應用於您的專案中。同時也歡迎將本模組用於任何模組包中（若能標註來源或連結回此頁面將不勝感激）。</span>\n</p>",
